# Keep the matchmaking image small. Study artifacts are multi-GB and have
# crashed Docker Desktop when they slipped into the build context.
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache

# Run outputs (any depth). Prefer explicit trees below as well.
**/runs
**/runs/**
**/results
**/results/**

# Entire study trees — not needed in the product Compose image.
obj-b.matchmaking/studies
obj-a/kv-store/studies
obj-a/sanity-check
obj-a/mockups
obj-a/tests
obj-b.matchmaking/tests
obj-b.matchmaking/cpp

# Local logs / plots left next to studies or orchestration.
**/*.log
**/etrace.png
**/use.png
**/resplot.png
